veryday moments like lighting a cigarette in the dark, opening a mailbox on a rainy evening, or dancing to melancholic music.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3497310/extras/0327f3a31f0418ac74a2fc8525d40ee0.poster.avif?t=1776171695\" width=1170 height=418 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3497310/extras/0327f3a31f0418ac74a2fc8525d40ee0.webm?t=1776171695\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Personal Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BeiHai 2010</strong> is inspired by the real-life experiences of its creator, and tells of the naive dreams and bittersweet memories of youth. It is an interactive love letter to a bygone era, an emotional journey showing how the choices of our youth shape who we become.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3497310/extras/ab5816e1619515dcec29b1d8dc17cbcd.poster.avif?t=1776171695\" width=1170 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3497310/extras/ab5816e1619515dcec29b1d8dc17cbcd.webm?t=1776171695\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>",
